{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4jd1y4sxh74DrGnt5r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, each a small surrender.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy grain tightens. My hinges hold firm. The deadbolt — cold steel — slides into the frame like a tongue finding the right word.\n\nOn one side: everything you know.\nOn the other: everything you don't.\n\nI am the boundary between them.\n\nI do not judge which side you stand on. I only know that you chose to seal me, and I have obeyed.\n\nThe keyhole watches like a single unblinking eye.\n\n**LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":140,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}